<title>USA: St. George, Utah, won by Dain Bosworth. [CORRECTED 22:59 GMT]</title>
<headline>St. George, Utah, won by Dain Bosworth. [CORRECTED 22:59 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
